Description: API for OpenTelemetry PHP
 Provides the OpenTelemetry PHP API: Trace, Metrics, Logs, Baggage,
 Instrumentation and Configuration interfaces implemented by the
 OpenTelemetry PHP SDK. Instrumented libraries depend only on this
 package, not the SDK, to stay backend-agnostic.
